_6f4w8g0"><div class="_1595km00"><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _1yc463g0 _1yc463g1 _1yc463g1t _1yc463g8 _18yaz4f4">1,001-5,000</span></div></div></div><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf59 _11epkyfhh _11epkyfha _11epkyfgt _11epkyfn _10pyvlc2j _10pyvlc2p"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _11epkyfr _11epkyfp _11epkyfhx _11epkyfi1 _11epkyfbx _11epkyfbi _11epkyf81 _11epkyf8m _6f4w8g0 _6f4w8g4"><h3 class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _1yc463g0 _1yc463g3 _1yc463g1t _1yc463g8 _18yaz4f4">Primary location</h3></div><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _11epkyfr _11epkyfp _11epkyfi5 _11epkyfbx _11epkyfbi _11epkyf81 _11epkyf8m _6f4w8g0"><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _1yc463g0 _1yc463g1 _1yc463g1t _1yc463g8 _18yaz4f4">Jl. Tebet Raya, Jakarta Selatan, DKI Jakarta, Indonesia</span></div></div><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf59 _11epkyfhh _11epkyfha _11epkyfgt _11epkyfn _10pyvlc2j _10pyvlc2p"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _11epkyfr _11epkyfp _11epkyfi5 _11epkyfbx _11epkyfbi _11epkyf81 _11epkyf8m _6f4w8g0"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf7x"><div class="_1595km00"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf5d"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf5h _11epkyfp _11epkyfi _11epkyf0 _11epkyf6" data-testid="readmore-measure-full" aria-hidden="true"><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _1yc463g0 _1yc463g1 _1yc463g1t _1yc463g8 _18yaz4f4">Nexwave Technologies is the premier regional provider of network engineering services and supplier of specialized telecommunication products. We design, build and manage telecommunication networks and provide comprehensive suite of specialized products and cost effective solutions to address the network infrastructure need of fixed and mobile operators in Asia-Pacific.<!-- -->We have diverse network experiences and excellent track records in successful implementation of GSM, GPRS, CDMA, 3G/UMTS networks. Many telecommunication service operators in the Asia Pacific region and the world’s biggest equipment vendors have made Nexwave Technologies their service partner of choice.<!-- -->Our core belief of integrity, passion and trust are the key values underlying the strong partnerships we are enjoying with our customers and business partners.<!-- -->Nexwave Technologies Pte Ltd is a wholly-owned subsidiary of TeleChoice International Limited.</span></div><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf5h _11epkyfp _11epkyfi _11epkyf0 _11epkyf6" data-testid="readmore-measure-preview" aria-hidden="true"><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _11epkyfr _1yc463g0 _1yc463g1 _1yc463g1t _1yc463g8 _18yaz4f4 _1acm36c0"><span class="_1595km00 _1acm36c2 _11epkyf4x _11epkyf0 _11epkyfr _1acm36c4" style="--_1acm36c3:3">Nexwave Technologies is the premier regional provider of network engineering services and supplier of specialized telecommunication products. We design, build and manage telecommunication networks and provide comprehensive suite of specialized products and cost effective solutions to address the network infrastructure need of fixed and mobile operators in Asia-Pacific.<!-- -->We have diverse network experiences and excellent track records in successful implementation of GSM, GPRS, CDMA, 3G/UMTS networks. Many telecommunication service operators in the Asia Pacific region and the world’s biggest equipment vendors have made Nexwave Technologies their service partner of choice.<!-- -->Our core belief of integrity, passion and trust are the key values underlying the strong partnerships we are enjoying with our customers and business partners.<!-- -->Nexwave Technologies Pte Ltd is a wholly-owned subsidiary of TeleChoice International Limited.</span></span></div><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _11epkyfr _1yc463g0 _1yc463g1 _1yc463g1t _1yc463g8 _18yaz4f4 _1acm36c0"><span class="_1595km00 _1acm36c2 _11epkyf4x _11epkyf0 _11epkyfr _1acm36c4" style="--_1acm36c3:3">Nexwave Technologies is the premier regional provider of network engineering services and supplier of specialized telecommunication products. We design, build and manage telecommunication networks and provide comprehensive suite of specialized products and cost effective solutions to address the network infrastructure need of fixed and mobile operators in Asia-Pacific.<!-- -->We have diverse network experiences and excellent track records in successful implementation of GSM, GPRS, CDMA, 3G/UMTS networks. Many telecommunication service operators in the Asia Pacific region and the world’s biggest equipment vendors have made Nexwave Technologies their service partner of choice.<!-- -->Our core belief of integrity, passion and trust are the key values underlying the strong partnerships we are enjoying with our customers and business partners.<!-- -->Nexwave Technologies Pte Ltd is a wholly-owned subsidiary of TeleChoice International Limited.</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf8l _11epkyf9p _1yc463g10 _1yc463g13 _11epkyf33 _11epkyf36"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf59 _11epkyfhh _11epkyf71"><div class="_1595km00"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf59 _11epkyfhh _11epkyf6x"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf59 _11epkyfhh _11epkyf6t"><h3 class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _1yc463g0 _1yc463gh _1yc463gm _18yaz4f4 _1yc463g1t">Jobs at Nexwave</h3><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _1yc463g0 _1yc463g1 _1yc463g1t _1yc463g8 _18yaz4f4">Based on your search activity</span></div><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf6t j9c5t25" style="--j9c5t21:1;--j9c5t22:2;--j9c5t23:2;--j9c5t24:2"><div class="_1595km00 _1flfxkk0"><div class="_1595km00"><article class="_1595km00 _1595km01 _11epkyf95 _11epkyf8q _11epkyf81 _11epkyf7m _11epkyfbd _11epkyfay _11epkyfa9 _11epkyf9u _11epkyfh _11epkyf69 _11epkyf5d _1biv7eea _1biv7ee8 _1biv7ee9 _1yc463g10 _1yc463g13 _11epkyf33 _11epkyf36" data-automation="normalJob" data-testid="job-card" data-job-id="92291697" data-card-type="JobCard" id="jobcard-1" aria-selected="false"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _11epkyf4v"><a href="/job/92291697?cid=company-profile&amp;ref=company-profile" class="_1595km00 _1595km0g _1595km08 _11epkyf5h _11epky