work engineering services and supplier of specialized telecommunication products. We design, build and manage telecommunication networks and provide comprehensive suite of specialized products and cost effective solutions to address the network infrastructure need of fixed and mobile operators in Asia-Pacific.","We have diverse network experiences and excellent track records in successful implementation of GSM, GPRS, CDMA, 3G/UMTS networks. Many telecommunication service operators in the Asia Pacific region and the world’s biggest equipment vendors have made Nexwave Technologies their service partner of choice.","Our core belief of integrity, passion and trust are the key values underlying the strong partnerships we are enjoying with our customers and business partners.","Nexwave Technologies Pte Ltd is a wholly-owned subsidiary of TeleChoice International Limited."],"traditionalLand":null,"traditionalPlace":null},"customStatement":{"__typename":"CompanyProfileCustomStatement","title":"Why join us?","description":["We are a major employer of RF specialist and engineers and is constantly on a lookout from more people to join us. We would like to invite you get registered with us, so that we can keep in touch with you whenever there is any opening which is suitable for you."]},"missionStatement":null,"featured":null,"awards":null,"cultureAndValues":null,"perksAndBenefits":null,"gallery":[{"__typename":"CompanyProfileGallery","title":null,"date":null,"linkUrl":"https://image-service-cdn.seek.com.au/afc95f7220de68d4cd4d9fb8bfe63fc98db8965a"},{"__typename":"CompanyProfileGallery","title":null,"date":null,"linkUrl":"https://image-service-cdn.seek.com.au/ca58a2159f1fd4afa82e150cc4522826c8a71ad3"},{"__typename":"CompanyProfileGallery","title":null,"date":null,"linkUrl":"https://image-service-cdn.seek.com.au/830ce1ccd3cf4d0419b5f3d8fe4061af1b3e8048"},{"__typename":"CompanyProfileGallery","title":null,"date":null,"linkUrl":"https://image-service-cdn.seek.com.au/c4f7adeca80b97